    "name": "CFS (Chinese Football Simulator)",
    "steam_appid": 3304320,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dear International Players,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm Gookoo Games, the solo developer of this indie football title. As this is a one-person project, please kindly wait for localized versions. I promise to prioritize multilingual support as development progresses. Thank you for your interest!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Foreword</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike other Chinese football games filled with self-deprecating jokes, repetitive memes, or excessive focus on negative stereotypes, this game carries a different vision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I believe in Chinese football's brighter future. We're no football desert. Even if we're not at our best today, we deserve dreams - to find our path forward with courage and determination.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Chinese Football Simulator</i> delivers an authentic local football management experience with Chinese characteristics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond standard 3D match simulations, team management, and youth academy development, you'll:<br>\u2022 Tour across China's football landscape<br>\u2022 Forge mutually beneficial relationships<br>\u2022 Scout hidden gems from grassroots/amateur circuits<br>\u2022 Customize every aspect through MOD Workshop</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >May you thrive in China's vibrant football world!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome, Boss</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 As both club owner and manager, choose your background and operate your team freely. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Customize: Tactics \u2022 Kits \u2022 Badges \u2022 Stadiums \u2022 Facilities \u2022 Stand decorations \u2022 and more</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304320/extras/b5fed1bfa0ecd0f59a52da4fdcd1b18d.avif?t=1753325249\" data-has-big width=800 height=412 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304320/extras/3a7835555c1afca96a1c24e4f0601c65.avif?t=1753325249\" data-has-big width=800 height=406 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Football Journey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit major cities, establish affiliate clubs, and build your network through reciprocal relationships with NPCs.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304320/extras/f68fb76ef3917eccbda096990aa8f667.avif?t=1753325249\" data-has-big width=800 height=416 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Match Simulation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While still improving, we're committed to delivering 3D match simulations with tactical camera perspectives.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304320/extras/3e9f8fe6da95b95d9c9ed0b615a6f9bf.avif?t=1753325249\" data-has-big width=800 height=406 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Reputation System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your prestige through:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Social connections (&quot;face&quot; culture)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Strategic promises during transfer negotiations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304320/extras/e9d3771643b290ee7a43ea18b77954bd.avif?t=1753325249\" data-has-big width=800 height=402 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Historical Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover China's football origins through journalists' stories.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304320/extras/436fc46bb32a77e86b31f4e1810969ef.avif?t=1753325249\" data-has-big width=800 height=408 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MOD Workshop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Customize all game elements via community mods:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Rosters \u2022 Player models \u2022 Dynamic backgrounds \u2022 and beyond</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304320/extras/5c27a0b2f80d192bcee32a0ae43d8551.avif?t=1753325249\" data-has-big width=800 height=412 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
