tand decorations \u2022 and more</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304320/extras/b5fed1bfa0ecd0f59a52da4fdcd1b18d.avif?t=1753325249\" data-has-big width=800 height=412 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304320/extras/3a7835555c1afca96a1c24e4f0601c65.avif?t=1753325249\" data-has-big width=800 height=406 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Football Journey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit major cities, establish affiliate clubs, and build your network through reciprocal relationships with NPCs.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304320/extras/f68fb76ef3917eccbda096990aa8f667.avif?t=1753325249\" data-has-big width=800 height=416 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Match Simulation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While still improving, we're committed to delivering 3D match simulations with tactical camera perspectives.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304320/extras/3e9f8fe6da95b95d9c9ed0b615a6f9bf.avif?t=1753325249\" data-has-big width=800 height=406 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Reputation System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your prestige through:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Social connections (&quot;face&quot; culture)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Strategic promises during transfer negotiations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304320/extras/e9d3771643b290ee7a43ea18b77954bd.avif?t=1753325249\" data-has-big width=800 height=402 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Historical Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover China's football origins through journalists' stories.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304320/extras/436fc46bb32a77e86b31f4e1810969ef.avif?t=1753325249\" data-has-big width=800 height=408 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MOD Workshop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Customize all game elements via community mods:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Rosters \u2022 Player models \u2022 Dynamic backgrounds \u2022 and beyond</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304320/extras/5c27a0b2f80d192bcee32a0ae43d8551.avif?t=1753325249\" data-has-big width=800 height=412 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
